WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.403
-Michael, I thought
it would be fun -- "No more."

00:00:04.403 --> 00:00:07.774
-No more.
-For us to play a game.

00:00:07.774 --> 00:00:09.241
I know you like games, right?
-Yeah, yeah.

00:00:09.241 --> 00:00:10.343
-Yeah, so, this is a game
that I know

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:11.377
you're going to be great at.

00:00:11.377 --> 00:00:13.712
It's called
"Slow Turn, Tiny Nod."

00:00:13.712 --> 00:00:15.881
-♪ Slow Turn ♪

00:00:15.881 --> 00:00:20.787
-♪ Tiny Nod ♪

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:22.221
-Now, the game is very simple.

00:00:22.221 --> 00:00:25.191
One at a time, while maintaining
the utmost composure,

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:28.361
we will very slowly turn
our heads, look into camera,

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:29.863
and do the
tiniest head nod possible.

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:31.297
-Okay.

00:00:31.297 --> 00:00:37.637
-Whoever does the best slow
turn, tiny head nod will win.

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:39.939
And you're not allowed to laugh.
And you'll go first.

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:41.241
You ready for this?
-Yeah.

00:00:41.241 --> 00:00:44.176
-Alright. Michael, go ahead.
Slow turn, tiny nod.

00:00:44.176 --> 00:00:45.177
Whenever you're ready.

00:00:45.177 --> 00:00:47.213
[ Dramatic music playing ]

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:50.517
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.788
-Can I start again?
-Yeah.

00:00:55.788 --> 00:00:57.290
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Of course.

00:00:57.290 --> 00:01:00.192
-Hey, I know the point is
for you to enjoy yourselves,

00:01:00.192 --> 00:01:01.994
but you could help me out here.

00:01:01.994 --> 00:01:05.665
-Don't blame the audience.
Come on.

00:01:05.665 --> 00:01:08.501
Here we go. Come on, now.
-We're a team.

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:10.336
[ Dramatic music playing ]

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:16.575
-Geez, this is ridiculous!

00:01:16.575 --> 00:01:17.910
How does anybody do this?

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:20.613
-You tried. It's my turn now.
It's my turn. Here we go.

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:22.414
-Alright, fine.
-You lost that round.

00:01:22.414 --> 00:01:23.483
It's a very hard game.

00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:24.884
[ Clears throat ]
Here we go.

00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:26.886
[ Laughs ] Alright.

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:28.921
Ah-ha!

00:01:28.921 --> 00:01:31.457
[ Laughs ]

00:01:31.457 --> 00:01:34.359
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.359 --> 00:01:36.662
-He can't even start.

00:01:36.662 --> 00:01:38.164
I at least started.

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:40.934
[ Dramatic music playing ]

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:42.969
[ Drumroll ]

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:53.546
[ Cheers and applause ]
Wow.

00:01:58.651 --> 00:02:01.721
It's like you don't have
any feelings.

00:02:01.721 --> 00:02:03.389
-That's not true.

00:02:03.389 --> 00:02:04.790
Let's do Round 2, okay?

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:06.960
Let's up the stakes a
little bit, right?

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:09.328
Even slower.

00:02:09.328 --> 00:02:11.163
And then,
when you reach the camera,

00:02:11.163 --> 00:02:13.933
you have -- you got to
flare your nostrils twice

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:14.934
and then a tiny nod.

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:16.202
-Mm-hmm.

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:17.703
-I won't look at you.
I won't look at you.

00:02:17.703 --> 00:02:19.205
[ Dramatic music playing ]
-[ Humming ]

00:02:19.205 --> 00:02:21.241
[ Drumroll ]

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:28.047
[Bleep]

00:02:28.047 --> 00:02:30.517
-I had to look -- I had to look
because I was excited.

00:02:30.517 --> 00:02:31.984
I had to look
because I was excited.

00:02:31.984 --> 00:02:33.319
The magic was happening
right in front of me.

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:34.486
What was I supposed to do?

00:02:34.486 --> 00:02:37.990
So, turn, nose flare,
and then tiny nod.

00:02:37.990 --> 00:02:39.058
Here we go. Ready?

00:02:39.058 --> 00:02:40.226
[ Dramatic music playing ]

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:42.262
[ Drumroll ]

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:50.603
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:50.603 --> 00:02:52.972
-Wow.

00:02:52.972 --> 00:02:54.940
-Round 3.

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:56.475
-When you hear the noise
"Round 3,"

00:02:56.475 --> 00:02:58.410
that means it's Round 3.

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:00.513
This is -- this is it.

00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:03.182
This is for 5,000 points.
You're going to win.

00:03:03.182 --> 00:03:05.350
All you have to do is --
This is the last one.

00:03:05.350 --> 00:03:08.320
Turn your head, okay?

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:09.688
Look into Camera 3.

00:03:09.688 --> 00:03:12.024
-3. Yeah.
-Shimmy your shoulders.

00:03:12.024 --> 00:03:13.325
-Shimmy my shoulders.

00:03:13.325 --> 00:03:15.427
-While you say, "Looks like
we got dinner plans."

00:03:15.427 --> 00:03:16.729
-"Looks like we got
dinner plans."

00:03:16.729 --> 00:03:18.464
-"Looks like
we got dinner plans."

00:03:18.464 --> 00:03:20.499
-Obviously,
I'm going to be able to do this.

00:03:20.499 --> 00:03:23.736
-And then, finally, give
a tiny nod, maybe, at the end,

00:03:23.736 --> 00:03:25.104
if you feel like doing it.

00:03:25.104 --> 00:03:27.106
'Cause you haven't really
completed any of the tasks.

00:03:27.106 --> 00:03:30.709
-Right. I know.
Should I flare my nostrils, too?

00:03:30.709 --> 00:03:32.779
-You know, surprise me.
I mean, this is your take.

00:03:32.779 --> 00:03:34.680
-Alright.

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:35.815
-I'm not looking.

00:03:35.815 --> 00:03:37.383
Oops.
[ Dramatic music playing ]

00:03:37.383 --> 00:03:39.819
[ Drumroll ]
-Ooh.

00:03:46.492 --> 00:03:48.561
Looks like we got
dinner plans tonight.

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:51.197
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:51.197 --> 00:03:53.399
-That's how you do it
right there!

00:03:53.399 --> 00:03:56.435
That was "Slow Turn, Tiny Nod"!

00:03:56.435 --> 00:03:58.037
My thanks to Michael Shannon!

00:03:58.037 --> 00:04:00.873
"Nine Perfect Strangers"
premieres tomorrow on Hulu!

00:04:00.873 --> 00:04:01.874
That is how you do it!

